{
  "info": {
    "name": "TaskOrbit API & Academic Demonstrations",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman API Collection for TaskOrbit (Express Backend, Workflow Transitions, Conflict Engine, Stale Review Rejection) and Unit IV Spring Boot Reporting Academic Demo.\n\nAUTH: every request after \"Auth / Login\" is authenticated by the HttpOnly session cookie (Postman keeps it in its cookie jar). Run one of the Login requests first. A collection-level pre-request script adds the X-CSRF-Token header (saved by the login test script) to every state-changing request.",
